{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33926","headline":"江南道中怀茅山广文南阳博士三首 二 · 皮日休","name":"江南道中怀茅山广文南阳博士三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"住在华阳第八天，望君唯欲结良缘。\n堂扃洞里千秋燕，厨盖岩根数斗泉。\n坛上古松疑度世，观中幽鸟恐成仙。\n不知何事迎新岁，乌纳裘中一觉眠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33926.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33926","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}